OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity services remain
OL,4,Asuspended at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirthing services at a hospital in
OL,7,Fnorth Devon remain suspended following
OL,8,Fits latest "readiness assessment".
OL,10,FThe maternity unit at North Devon
OL,11,FDistrict Hospital has been closed since
OL,12,F11 August due to staffing problems,
OL,13,Fwith expectant parents calling the
OL,14,Fsituation a "nightmare".
OL,16,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,17,FTrust said it remained "committed to
OL,18,Freopening birthing services at NDDH as
OL,19,Fsoon as possible" and was continuing
OL,20,Fits efforts to "recruit both temporary
OL,21,Fand substantive staff".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
